0) prerequisites
    - node 16

1) In the debvstack`s .env file change this:
    - NODE_OPTIONS=--openssl-legacy-provider
  to this:
    - NODE_OPTIONS=

2) Install
    - git clone https://github.com/vuestorefront/storefront-nuxt2-magento2.git vue
    - cd vue
    - yarn install

3) Configurations:
    - cp .env.example .env of the project (vue storefront)
    - change this {YOUR_SITE_FRONT_URL} to 'https://dev-env.localhost/graphql' all over the .env
    - add NODE_TLS_REJECT_UNAUTHORIZED=0 to .env file if missed
    - add VSF_NUXT_APP_HOST=0.0.0.0     <--------- or it can be web-app ipd address
    - VSF_COOKIE_SECURE=                <--------- [empty string] for dev env in the .env file


4) Start
    - yarn dev

5) use only this:
    - http://localhost:3000/